---
const faqs = [
  { q: "What is EcoRouter?", a: "A unified resource router for agentic inference. Your agents ask for a capability, such as a model call, a web search, a scrape or a company lookup, and EcoRouter sends each step to the provider with the best live price and speed that fits the agent's spending cap." },
  { q: "How is this different from a model router?", a: "Model routers pick between LLMs. An agent run also pays for search, scraping, context and reranking. EcoRouter prices all of those steps in one place and holds them to one budget, so the cap covers the whole run, not just the tokens." },
  { q: "What happens when the cap runs out?", a: "The step stops before any provider is called, and the agent gets a refusal that says which cap was hit and what the cheapest quote was. It can drop the step, use a cheaper kind of step, or ask for more budget." },
  { q: "When does it reroute?", a: "Every step is routed fresh. If the last provider raised its price, got slower than the latency target, started failing, or no longer fits the budget left, the next step goes to the next provider that fits." },
  { q: "Where does Airwallex come in?", a: "Settlement. The plan is one Airwallex wallet that funds the caps, a virtual card per provider with limits that mirror the caps, FX on quotes priced in other currencies, and card transaction webhooks reconciled into receipts. It is in progress and not live yet." },
  { q: "Are the prices on this page real?", a: "No. They are example quotes chosen to show how routing behaves. The router will read live provider pricing and measured latency." },
];
---

<section id="faq" class="bg-paper pb-28 sm:pb-36">
  <div class="max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="rule-label"><span>Questions</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
    <div class="mt-10 border-t border-ink">
      {faqs.map((item) => (
        <details class="group border-b border-line-strong">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none select-none py-6 gap-6">
            <span class="font-display text-[19px] sm:text-[21px] font-medium tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink">{item.q}</span>
            <span class="shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-line-strong text-ink flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" /></svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <p class="pb-6 -mt-1 max-w-[760px] text-[16px] text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">{item.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
